摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"🐤 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）永久插件：Deep diving 回答期间用坤宠动图填满深潜状态行下方区块——进度条 0%→100%，每 20% 切换动作与文案，完成时系统级播放「你干嘛~哎哟」","id":"gh:1335044426","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-ikun-pet","slug":"eric-song-dev/dsh-ikun-pet","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","ikun","ikun-pet","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"🐤 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）永久插件：Deep diving 回答期间用坤宠动图填满深潜状态行下方区块——进度条 0%→100%，每 20% 切换动作与文案，完成时系统级播放「你干嘛"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"epSeek Harness（DSH）永久插件：Deep diving 回答期间用坤宠动图填满深潜状态行下方区块——进度条 0%→100%，每 20% 切换动作与文案，完成时系统级播放「你干嘛~哎哟」"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🐤 dsh-ikun-pet · ikun Desktop Pet"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 📖 中文文档：README.zh.md"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin that fills the full row under the **\"Deep diving...\" status line**"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" with an ikun pet during **every reply**:\n> a `0% → 100%` progress bar, **a new animation and text e"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"very 20%**, and a jump celebration with a system-level \"你干嘛~哎哟\" voice cue at completion 🏀"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Only fills the deep-dive dock**: registered at `conversation.input.dock` — the full row directly"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" below\nDSH's \"Deep diving...\" status line, between the conversation and the composer. Visible only w"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"hile a\nsession is `running` (deep diving); completely invisible the rest of the time.\n- **The pet wa"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"lks the progress bar**: the ikun pet walks from 3% to 97%, playing frame-by-frame on top of\nthe prog"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ress bar (8 columns × 9 rows sprite-sheet contract).\n- **A new stage every 20%**: six stages at 0/20"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"/40/60/80/100, each switching both the animation and the\ntext (see docs/PROGRESS-STAGES.md).\n- **Uni"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"versal adaptive progress**: a layered estimation model — real anchors (0% start / 100% done) +\nreal "},{"id":"p6s8","text":"goal-round progress + self-calibration from this session's turn durations + activity pacing for\ntool"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"s/streaming/approval-waiting + a shrinking reserve. Short tasks run fast, long tasks run slow,\nwaiti"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"ng for your approval slows it down honestly, and it never fakes 100%\n(details in docs/PROGRESS-STAGE"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"S.md).\n- **Completion heard system-wide**: at 100% the host process plays \"你干嘛~哎哟\" (`assets/voice.mp"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"3`)\nwith a system command — audible from any window and any session, independent of browser mute\n(te"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"sted on macOS).\n- **Permanent plugin form**: written into the DSH composition (`cordis.patch.yml`) a"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"nd auto-loaded on\nevery DSH start — install once, works in every session. Dynamic-plugin sources (`s"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"rc/`) are kept as\nan alternative for session-level installs."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🚀 Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Option A: clone** (for tinkerers)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Option B: remote one-liner** (for users)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Option C: npm** (prebuilt — installs without the `allowBuilds` build-approval step)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> 💡 If your profile isn't named `web`, swap `--profile web` for your own profile name in the command"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"our profile isn't named `web`, swap `--profile web` for your own profile name in the commands above."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` and refresh the browser. Verify:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## 🎬 Stage → animation → text"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Progress | Animation | Text |\n| ---: | --- | --- |\n| 0% – 20% | waiting | 深潜启动！准备出发… |\n| 20% – 40%"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" | runRight | 正在收集线索… |\n| 40% – 60% | working | 埋头苦干中… |\n| 60% – 80% | review | 认真思考中… |\n| 80% – 100"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"% | wave | 快好啦！马上见结果~ |\n| 100% (done) | jump | 完成啦！你干嘛~哎哟 🔉 (host plays the voice cue) |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration (optional)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Everything lives in the plugin line's `config` inside the bundled `cordis.patch.yml`:\n`spritePath` /"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" `voicePath` / `playVoiceAtDone` / `playCommand` (assets default to the bundled `assets/`)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Disable**: remove the `#` in front of `# disabled: true`, restart `dsh web` (put it back to re-e"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"nable)\n- **Mute the voice**: `config.playVoiceAtDone: false` (the animated bar is unaffected)\n- **Vo"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ice on Windows/Linux**: swap `playCommand` to PowerShell / ffplay (examples in the comments;\nmacOS d"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"efaults to `afplay`, tested)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 🗑 Uninstall / 🔄 Update"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🧪 Session-level install (dynamic plugin)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Hand the payload to your Agent to install via `cordis_define` + `cordis_run` — current session only."},{"id":"p26s2","text":"\n⚠️ Don't run it alongside the permanent plugin (their sprite routes conflict)."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 🖥 Platform support"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Part | macOS | Windows / Linux |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Animated UI + progress bar (pure Web) | ✅ tested | ⚠️ should work, untested |\n| Completion voice ("},{"id":"p29s2","text":"system command) | ✅ tested (`afplay`) | ⚠️ commands provided, untested |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 🛟 Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Symptom | Fix |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Plugin line fails on restart | `node -e \"require('dsh-ikun-pet')\"` in the profile dir should succe"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ed; reinstall if it doesn't |\n| Dock not showing but routes work | hard refresh (Cmd+Shift+R); make "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"sure the dynamic plugin isn't enabled at the same time |\n| No voice | check `config.playVoiceAtDone`"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"; macOS uses `afplay`, other OSes need a different `playCommand` |\n| Don't want it to load | add `di"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"sabled: true` to the plugin line and restart |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
